{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Well, excuse the hell out of me.": "",
  "Dude, that what you normally eat?": "",
  "Do you really have to\ncomment on everything I do...?": "",
  "Could do without the commentary...": "",
  "Look at you, buyin' gear and shit!": "",
  "Look at you, buyin' gear and shit.": "",
  "Yup. Never know what's\ngonna happen out there.": "",
  "Yup, better to be prepared.": "",
  "Don't forget the mission, yeah?": "",
  "I won't. This is all part of the plan.": "",
  "What's up, Kaito-san?": "",
  "Those Matsugane assholes ain't biting.\nYou might wanna try lookin' even weaker.": "",
  "If the Matsugane are around, they ain't biting.\nCan't you look more pathetic?": "",
  "And how am I gonna do that?": "",
  "Huh? Sure, but... How?": "",
  "Hmmm... Maybe if you tried\ngetting drunk?": "",
  "Hmmm, well... Maybe if you tried\ngetting drunk?": "",
  "Not a bad idea.\nGuess I'll stop by Tender, then.": "",
  "Drinking, huh? Not a bad idea.\nGuess I'll stop by Tender, then.": "",
  "Well you sure took your sweet time in there.\nDid you forget the mission, Tak?": "",
  "Yo. You sure took your sweet time in there, Tak.\nYou forget the whole plan?": "",
  "You're supposed to be luring out Hamura's goons,\nnot drinking with the fuckin' locals.": "",
  "You're supposed to be luring out Hamura's goons, right?\nNot chatting up the locals!": "",
  "...Seriously? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>You're</font_kind> the one who told me to get drunk.": "",
  "...Seriously? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>You're</font_kind> the one who told me\nto get drunk.": "",
  "Guess I did, huh? I'm sick of waiting, though!\nHow 'bout we just go bust into the Matsugane office?": "",
  "Yeah... I'm just sick of waitin', though!\nHow 'bout we just go bust into the Matsugane office?": "",
  "Think about how many guys they've got.\nWe'd be fools to charge in there.": "",
  "Uh, bad idea. Think about how many guys they've got.\nWe'd be fools to charge in there.": "",
  "Then... Oh, I got it!": "",
  "Do you now.": "",
  "Try goin' to one of the Matsugane clubs.": "",
  "Try goin' to one of the\nMatsugane's clubs.": "",
  "And that'll help, how?": "",
  "How would that help?": "",
  "You just show up and tell\n'em Yagami's here.": "",
  "You waltz right up to the Matsugane's doorstep,\nand tell 'em Yagami's here.": "",
  "Word'll probably make it up\nto Hamura in no time.": "",
  "After that, it shouldn't take too long.\nWord'll make it up to Hamura in no time.": "",
  "You know, that might actually work. Just point me\nto a club and we'll go from there.": "",
  "I see... That might actually work.\nJust point me to the nearest club.": "",
  "Lemme see... Why don't you try Alvin,\nover on Tenkaichi Street?": "",
  "Lemme see... Why don't you try\nAlvin, over on Tenkaichi Street?": "",
  "All right, I'll head over now.": "",
  "Okay, sure. I'll head over now.": "",
  "Hm? What's going on?": "",
  "Didn't you hear what we said last week?\nI want a fuckin' answer, today!": "",
  "Look, we told you last week!\nI want a fuckin' answer, today!": "",
  "Please, it's not exactly possible right now.": "",
  "Please, it's not exactly possible...": "",
  "It better be fucking possible!": "",
  "With how fast your management costs're rising,\nof course your protection's gonna cost more!": "",
  "When management costs go up,\nprotection goes up right along with it!": "",
  "N-No...": "",
  "N-No way...": "",
  "Tak, those thugs are Matsugane.\nNo doubt about it.": "",
  "Tak, take a look.\nThose thugs are Matsugane boys for sure.": "",
  "Yeah, looks like.": "",
  "Maybe you should, uh... help or something?\nThat guy looks like he could use a hand.": "",
  "You can step in if you want?\nI dunno, that guy might appreciate it.": "",
  "You could at least <font_kind=yakuza_italic>try</font_kind>\nto sound interested.": "",
  "Kaito-san... At least <font_kind=yakuza_italic>try</font_kind> to sound interested.": "",
  "Just hurry up and get it over with.": "",
  "I think you've had enough\nfun for one day.": "",
  "Hey. I think that's enough.": "",
  "Huh? The fuck...?": "",
  "Wait, that's Yagami!\nThe hell're you doin' here!?": "",
  "Wait, it's Yagami!\nThe hell're you doin' here!?": "",
  "My question first.\nWhy are you threatening this civilian?": "",
  "First, I'd like to know why you're\nthreatening this civilian.": "",
  "None of your fuckin' business!": "",
  "Ugh, watch the volume. Or is yelling\nthe only thing a dumb guy like you can do?": "",
  "Hey, turn it down, would you?\nOr is yelling the only volume you've got?": "",
  "Ohhh, that must be why you're bottom\nof the ladder. It all makes sense now.": "",
  "Ohhh, that must be why you're\nbottom of the ladder. I get it now.": "",
  "You little... I'll slaughter you!": "",
  "Listen up!": "",
  "Eep...!": "",
  "Go tell your precious Captain Hamura\nthat Yagami was here. Got that?": "",
  "Go cry to Captain Hamura\nand tell him Yagami was here!": "",
  "Just do it.": "",
  "On your way now.": "",
  "Y'know, Tak...\nThis strategy's pretty solid, huh?": "",
  "Y'know, Tak... this strategy's\npretty solid, huh?": "",
  "Well, we'll find out soon enough.": "",
  "Yeah, we'll see.": "",
  "You know any other Matsugane joints,\nKaito-san? We should hit a few, just to be safe.": "",
  "Kaito-san, you know any other Matsugane joints?\nWe should hit a few, just to be safe.": "",
  "Hm... There's Romance of the Three Kinkdoms\nover on Pink Street.": "",
  "Fantastic Romance on West Shichifuku, and...\nOh, Sweet Billow on East Shichifuku.": "",
  "Fantastic Romance on West Shichifuku,\nand... Sweet Billow on East Shichifuku.": "",
  "All right, I'll try all of 'em.": "",
  "So, this is Sweet Billow, huh?": "",
  "Meaning the guy puffing away\nover there is probably an employee.": "",
  "Meaning the guy puffing away over there\nis probably an employee.": "",
  "Why don't you quit standing\naround and go find out?": "",
  "Quit standing around\nand go find out.": "",
  "Someone's bossy today...": "",
  "Just do it, Tak.": "",
  "Hey, you work here?": "",
  "...I do. Why?": "",
  "...Yes, but why?": "",
  "Lemme ask you something.\nThis is a Matsugane establishment, right?": "",
  "The name's Yagami. Don't worry,\nI won't stick around much longer.": "",
  "The name's Yagami.\nDon't worry, I won't stick around much longer.": "",
  "Just tell your boss\nI dropped by to say hello.": "",
  "Just tell your boss Yagami\ndropped by to say hello.": "",
  "...What's going on here?": "",
  "Look, just tell him, okay?\nI've gotta run.": "",
  "Nothing. Just tell him, okay?\nAnyway, I've gotta run.": "",
  "(That should do it.\nWhere to next?)": "",
  "So, this is Romance of the Three Kinkdoms?": "",
  "How 'bout stopping in for a round, pal?\nWe got the finest girls to satisfy any kink!": "",
  "Hey, pal! How 'bout stopping in for a round?\nWe got the girls for any kink!": "",
  "Do you work here?": "",
  "Yeah! Just come on in, buddy!\nI'll give you a great deal!": "",
  "Yup! Just come on in, buddy!\nI'll give you a great deal!": "",
  "This is a Matsugane place, right?": "",
  "Huh? What're you... I, uh...\nI don't want any trouble, man.": "",
  "Huh? What...? I don't know, uh...\nI don't want any trouble, man.": "",
  "It's not like that.": "",
  "Just tell your boss Yagami stopped by.": "",
  "Just tell your boss something.\nYagami stopped by.": "",
  "Uh... I'm not sure I follow.": "",
  "Yagami? I don't get it...": "",
  "Just do it, okay? I gotta go.": "",
  "It's fine. There's not much else to it.\nNow, I better go.": "",
  "So this place is Fantastic Romance.": "",
  "So this place is Fantastic Romance?": "",
  "It's good to see you, gentlemen!": "",
  "Don't \"good to see you\" me.\nYou're late on your payment and you know it.": "",
  "Sure. You've been late on\nyour payments.": "",
  "I'm sorry, sir.\nOur sales haven't been the best this month...": "",
  "I'm sorry, sir.\nOur sales have been down...": "",
  "Then work on your pitch. Just being open's\nnot enough to bring in customers.": "",
  "Then work on your pitch.\nYou can't just sit and wait for customers.": "",
  "Looks like you're right on time, Tak!": "",
  "Hey, Tak! Looks like you're right on time!": "",
  "Go on, introduce yourself!": "",
  "Go on, let's see your big entrance!": "",
  " Yeah, sure.": "",
  "Excuse me, are you guys open?": "",
  "Excuse me. You guys open?": "",
  "Welcome, sir. We—": "",
  "Welcome, sir...": "",
  "What the! Yagami!?": "",
  "Oh, are you from the Matsugane Family?\nIt's good to see you.": "",
  "Oh, huh! You from the\nMatsugane Family? Evening.": "",
  "Who the fuck do you think you are,\nstrollin' up on us like it's no big deal?": "",
  "I wanna see Captain Hamura.\nKnow where he is?": "",
  "I wanna see Captain Hamura.\nGot any idea where he is?": "",
  "You little shit.\nWho do you think you're talking to!?": "",
  "You what...? Little shit.\nWho do you think you're talking to!?": "",
  "You're never meetin' Hamura...\n'cause you're gonna die right here!": "",
  "You're never meetin' the captain...\n'cause you're gonna die right here!": "",
  "Heh. Satisfied?": "",
  "Gah...! Shit!": "",
  "If you know what's good for you,\nyou'll report this to your family.": "",
  "If I were you, I'd report this\nto the family.": "",
  "I'm out of here.": "",
  "Now, I should get going.": "",
  "(All right, I've been everywhere\nKaito-san mentioned.)": "",
  "Yo, it's Kaito.\nThat was freakin' amazing, Tak.": "",
  "Yo, it's Kaito. That was freakin' amazing, Tak.\nNice job out there.": "",
  "Yup, absolute perfection.\nHamura'll have guys on your ass in no time.": "",
  "Yup, absolute perfection. If I know Hamura,\nhe'll have guys on your ass in no time.": "",
  "Just keep walkin' around town.\nWon't be long 'til they jump you.": "",
  "All you gotta do is just keep walkin' around town.\nWon't be long 'til they jump you.": "",
  "Yo, Tak. Why don't you head somewhere\nwith less people hangin' around?": "",
  "Yo, Tak. Why don't you head somewhere\nwith less people?": "",
  "Those Matsugane assholes aren't dumb\nenough to jump you with so many witnesses in sight.": "",
  "They aren't dumb enough to jump you\nwith so many witnesses.": "",
  "Where'd you have in mind?": "",
  "I was thinkin' the Champion District.": "",
  "Streets're so narrow there they'll\nbe more than happy to ambush you.": "",
  "Streets're so narrow there, they'll be\nlicking their chops.": "",
  "Well that's a scary thought...\nBut okay. I'll head over now.": "",
  "Well, that's a scary thought... but okay.": "",
  "Get after him, Tak! Make him cough\nup all he knows about Hamura!": "",
  "Get after him, Tak!\nWe need his info on Hamura!": "",
  "Phew. I think we lost 'em.": "",
  "Okay... I think we lost 'em.": "",
  "What about... Kaito-san?": "",
  "Hamura shot him in the stomach...\nso he'd have to carry him out. After that, I dunno.": "",
  "Hamura shot him in the stomach... Those yakuza\nhave him now. That's all we know.": "",
  "Dammit. We've gotta go after him!": "",
  "Damn it! We've gotta go after him!": "",
  "...Hold on.\nHow'd you know where we were?": "",
  "...Hold on. How'd you know\nwhere we were?": "",
  "I was sittin' in the van listening in on the Matsugane office.\nThey all rolled out, so I followed.": "",
  "I was listening to the Matsugane office, since I was\nstuck sitting back here. They rolled out, so I followed.": "",
  "Do you know where Hamura's holed up, then?\nMaybe they dropped a hint while you were listening.": "",
  "Do you know where Hamura's holed up, then?\nWas there any hint of it as you listened?": "",
  "Hm... I did hear them mention\nthe \"Soleil Building\" once or twice.": "",
  "You think that's where\nthey took Kaito-san?": "",
  "Soleil...? Think that's where they\ntook Kaito-san?": "",
  "Can't say for sure.\nHe could be anywhere, really.": "",
  "Can't say for sure.\nHe could be anywhere.": "",
  "But it's worth lookin' into. It sounded like\nSoleil has been abandoned for a while.": "",
  "But I think it's gotta be some kinda\nabandoned building in Kamurocho.": "",
  "We can second-guess ourselves later,\nthen. Let's get moving.": "",
  "We can second-guess ourselves later.\nLet's go.": "",
  "That's it.\nThe Soleil Building.": "",
  "That's the Soleil Building.": "",
  "Hold on, I recognize those guys out front.\nThey're Matsugane for sure.": "",
  "I recognize those guys out front.\nThey're Matsugane for sure.": "",
  "Does that mean Kaito-san's\nactually in there?": "",
  "What does that mean for Kaito-san?\nHe's actually in there?": "",
  "Hard to tell from out here.\nLooks like their guard's down, though.": "",
  "Hard to tell from out here.\nBut... looks like their guard's down.": "",
  "Guess we've just gotta bust in,\nthen. Sooner the better.": "",
  "Guess we've just gotta bust in, then.\nSooner the better.": "",
  "Yagami-san, you all set?": "",
  "Yup, let's go.": "",
  "Gotcha. Lemme know\nwhen you wanna go.": "",
  "Gotcha. Lemme know when\nyou wanna go.": "",
  "You ready yet, Yagami-san?\nWe're breakin' in there, right?": "",
  "Yagami-san? We're breakin' in there, right?\nYou ready to go?": "",
  "Huh? Oh, good.": "",
  "Gotcha.\nLemme know when you wanna go.": "",
  "Hey, that's... Yagami!\nYou got balls showin' up around here!": "",
  "Hey, that's... Yagami!\nYou got balls showin' up here!": "",
  "Let's go, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Is it... over, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Yagami-san? Is it over?": "",
  "Shit, we can't fight like this!\nFind the light switch, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Whoa, shit... Yagami-san, get the lights!\nWe can't fight like this!": "",
  "Gimme a second.": "",
  "Phew, thanks.": "",
  "(It's locked.\nCan't pick a lock without light.)": "",
  "Lemme guess, turn the lights on?\nCan't you do it yourself?": "",
  "Yeah, yeah, the lights.\nI get it already.": "",
  "How... DARE you!": "",
  "You think you're real clever, huh?": "",
  "Yeah. Glad you're okay.\nCome gimme a hand.": "",
  "Sugiura... Glad you're okay.\nHelp me with this lug.": "",
  "How do you feel, Kaito-san?": "",
  "Kaito-san, how do you feel?": "",
  "What, me? It was just a scratch.": "",
  "What, me? It's just a scratch.": "",
  "I'm good on my own.": "",
  "I can handle myself...": "",
  "Ngh!": "",
  "Still acting tough with lead in your stomach?\nWho you trying to impress?": "",
  "Still actin' tough with lead in your stomach?\nCome on...": "",
  "Yo. Lemme jump in, too.": "",
  "Yo. We don't have all day.": "",
  "Higashi...": "",
  "Matsugane-san, too...": "",
  "My van's right outside.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Hm? What's going on?": "อืม? เกิดอะไรขึ้นเหรอ?",
  "N-No...": "ไ-ไม่นะ...",
  "N-No way...": "ไ-ไม่จริงน่า...",
  "Listen up!": "ฟังนะ!",
  "Eep...!": "อี๊ดดด...!",
  "Just do it.": "ทำตามที่บอกก็พอ",
  "It's not like that.": "ไม่ใช่อย่างนั้นหรอก",
  "Yup, let's go.": "เออ ไปกันเถอะ",
  "Gimme a second.": "ขอเวลาแป๊บนึง",
  "Ngh!": "อึก!"
 }
}
